Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 16:24:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add MESH_SOAK beta tooling (mesh soak campaign data
 collector)

[mesh_soak] klippy module: MESH_SOAK NUM=<n> BED_TEMP=<t> runs N
BED_MESH_CALIBRATE cycles (default 5), logging per-run success/failure,
the hx711s tuning settings, and build version to klippy.log, capturing
per-channel force samples via a new hx711s sample-listener hook, and
bundling README (upload instructions), settings, results, force.jsonl
and klippy.log into /user-resource/mesh-results-<ts>.tar.gz for
community testers to attach to the kalico PR.
